	"data": "Journal — 2026-05-18 15:17\n\nSummary\n\nThe speaker excitedly documents a creative vision for 'Room 2.0'—a pure augmented reality system using Quest 3 to create contextual interfaces anchored to physical devices like Raspberry Pis and workstations. They detail plans for web-based AR menus, SSH terminal access, and a custom spatial coordinate system for their home, even considering light nanoseconds as a measurement unit.\n\nMood & Energy\n\n| Signal | Acoustic | Semantic |\n|---|---|---|\n| Emotion |…",
